WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.500
Ana: Good morning! Oh, I'm very tired today.

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:15.340
Tom: Hi! Good morning. Please, sit here.

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:21.880
Ana: Thank you! I'm Ana. I'm from Mexico.

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:29.220
Tom: Nice to meet you, Ana. I'm Tom. I'm from Chicago.

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:39.160
Tom: I'm an engineer. And you?

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:44.020
Ana: I'm a nurse. I work at night. That's why I'm tired!

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:55.530
Tom: I'm tired too. This is my third coffee!

00:00:55.580 --> 00:01:02.980
Tom: Oh, look! This is my sister, Kate.

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:10.920
Kate: Hi, Ana! Nice to meet you. I'm a teacher, and I'm very happy today!

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:16.860
Ana: Nice to meet you, Kate! Goodbye, Tom. See you tomorrow!

